1.1.0 2026-10-10
  - sub-A03 removed: data-quality artifact affecting this participant only
  - Added derivatives/localizer-maps/: subject-level localizer t-maps, group maps
    and atlas correlations for 117 participants
  - Added the multiple-demand localizer runs and the second fieldmap of sub-A58,
    which were missing from 1.0.0
  - Added language_background/participants_extended.tsv
  - sub-A33: removed the anatomical-only ses-01, which duplicated the T1w in ses-02,
    and relabelled ses-02 as ses-01, as for the other single-session participants
  - Added code/: the CONN/EvLab scripts used to preprocess the localizer data
    and estimate the first-level models
  - participants.tsv and language_background/participants_extended.tsv:
    added a scanner column identifying which of the two scanners each
    participant was scanned on
  - participants.tsv and language_background/participants_extended.tsv:
    L3_language and L4_language now use n/a instead of 0.0 where the
    participant does not speak a third or fourth language

